A personal wiki in one Python file. 41 lines, no dependencies.

[Source code](https://github.com/lchen198/wypyplus) | DemoPage | GetThingsDone | [All pages](wypyplus.py?p=All&q=f)

## Start here

* Click ✎ at the top to edit this page. Save to see the change.
* Join two capitalised words into one, like the page names above, to link to a page. Click the ? after a new name to create it.
* Save a page with no text to delete it.
* Every page is a plain text file in the w folder.

## Learn more

* DemoPage shows all the formatting.
* GetThingsDone shows how to organise your tasks with tags and templates.

## Read-only mode

In wypyplus.py, delete the ✎ character and keep the empty quotes around it. Editing, saving and search are turned off.
